\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qaYiT98knwQ7kNvwGCd41k&_nc_oc=AdmWiuPQFO30KlLJAkCGmKpImW9t6vkYYNxN7dFZ0nfqJ-AjkjBPLU57JPPcGxc33NE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzfhL8qQSoL-lRUTqBVicNljjrvzj3x1rceD9KWKGTTNg&oe=69AFFEF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fF6Pev5WKfIQ7kNvwE-pdho&_nc_oc=Admxm_NADjg5hfOXlCMAELSI3lCVg3AjLKCtWJ8Zegbh3Xrj5fVDj5B33jyeov9lQCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyWZhEySPAZ-6dda3tg2CYZOMhvI3dps08On_CAifNxCQ&oe=69B00056"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VzJxD88NTAgQ7kNvwFXfCiL&_nc_oc=AdkOp-m-JHda75axZCCC2gu0hWZoB8ipHoEPlSlxD2wSOMa5aj--sPI9_bHaMG-osy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx4hPtzoc4X55FymeXLiIgtni_0HjmWlz6brYnaA4_2GQ&oe=69B01577"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771